<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Patience - feat. YUNGBLUD &amp; Polo G</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">KSI</ttm:agent><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v2">YUNGBLUD</ttm:agent><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v3">Polo G</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">All Over The Place (Platinum VIP Edition)</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">4yjfHlTgLEzuRFtnck1K4W</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:00.270" end="00:06.620">Little bit, little bit, little bit</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:06.620" end="00:10.160">I need a little bit of patience</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:10.160" end="00:14.300">'Cause we been goin' through changes</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:14.300" end="00:15.870">Uh, uh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:15.870" end="00:17.940">No patience, I've had enough</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:17.940" end="00:21.960">Spent too much time through these phases, it's just not addin' up</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:21.960" end="00:25.860">Felt all alone on those stages, wanna get my passion up</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:25.860" end="00:31.810">It's over, pack it up, don't walk away from me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:31.810" end="00:36.290">When the night falls, make the right call</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.290" end="00:37.830">Or she'll be gone forever</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.830" end="00:41.620">I need a little bit of patience</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.620" end="00:45.570">'Cause we been goin' through changes</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.570" end="00:49.420">I need a little bit of patience</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:49.420" end="00:54.130" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Get out of crazy situations (ayy)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:54.130" end="00:58.240">And my heart won't change</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:58.240" end="01:01.330">If my head don't break</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:01.330" end="01:05.190">I need a little bit of patience</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:05.190" end="01:12.300" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">'Cause we been goin' through changes (oh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.300" end="01:16.300">Need a little space to slow the brain</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:16.300" end="01:20.060">I don't really wanna feel the pain</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:20.060" end="01:23.960">Seen a lot of shit to make me hate</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:23.960" end="01:28.530">I don't wanna hide until it's too late</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:28.530" end="01:32.940">Feels like I'm gonna break</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:32.940" end="01:36.740">I need a little bit of patience</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:36.740" end="01:40.620">'Cause we been goin' through changes</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:40.620" end="01:44.470">I need a little bit of patience</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:44.470" end="01:49.680" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Get out of crazy situations (ayy)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:49.680" end="01:53.500" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">And my heart won't change (ch-ch-ch-change)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:53.500" end="01:56.440">If my head don't break</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:56.440" end="02:00.300">I need a little bit of patience</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:00.300" end="02:06.570" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">'Cause we been goin' through changes (oh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:06.570" end="02:10.460">Bridges burnin', I won't let you get to me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:10.460" end="02:14.280">Tables turnin', I don't need bad energy</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:14.280" end="02:18.370">Now I'm learnin', lyin' 'bout our chemistry</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:18.370" end="02:20.030">No returnin', I-</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:20.030" end="02:23.800">I need a little bit of patience</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:23.800" end="02:27.630">'Cause we been goin' through changes</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:27.630" end="02:31.500">I need a little bit of patience</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:31.500" end="02:36.720" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Get out of crazy situations (ayy)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:36.720" end="02:40.730" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">And my heart won't change (ch-ch-ch-change)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:40.730" end="02:43.640">If my head don't break</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:43.640" end="02:47.440">I need a little bit of patience</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:47.440" end="02:51.610" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">'Cause we been goin' through changes (oh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:51.610" end="02:55.560">I need a little bit of patience</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:55.560" end="02:57.920">'Cause we been goin' through changes</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:57.920" end="03:01.920" /></div></body></tt>